@startuml
title OmniDesk AI Sprint Workflow

start

:Review approved milestone outcome;
:Refine product backlog;
:Select sprint backlog items;
:Define sprint goal;
:Define acceptance criteria;
:Break items into implementation tasks;
:Implement selected work;
:Run automated tests;
:Run quality and security checks;

if (All acceptance criteria satisfied?) then (yes)
  :Review sprint increment;
  :Record sprint completion;
else (no)
  :Return incomplete work for correction;
  :Update sprint backlog;
endif

stop

note right
A sprint produces a reviewable increment.

A sprint does not automatically
create a release.
end note

@enduml